[{"title":"新堂夜坐月色皎然由连理亭信步庭中徘徊久之因为五言一首","author":"鲜于侁","text":"秋风动微凉，天雨新霁后。\n閒斋独隐几，明月在高柳。\n振衣步庭下，颢气入襟袖。\n天空云汉明，隐约辨列宿。\n苍苍松桧上，零露飞欲溜。\n脱叶满閒园，繁华迨衰朽。\n清宵望蟾彩，宜付一杯酒。\n多病谢樽罍，城头转寒漏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29097,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"锦屏山","author":"鲜于侁","text":"分命叮咛诏旨宽，昼归聊憩锦屏山。\n寺门一路烟霞外，邑屋千家紫翠间。\n城山鼓鼙催日暮，雨中桃李报春还。\n江流此去朝宗急，远迹何时遂赐环。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29098,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题灵岩","author":"鲜于侁","text":"马烦箠策车驰毂，终岁尘劳常碌碌。\n喜闻岩寺在山中，路转清溪入幽谷。\n乍行山口疑洞天，穷深一上翻平田。\n千层台殿隐林木，四面石壁生云烟。\n山僧迎门笑相揖，为语祖师存德迹。\n屈指于今八百年，已在西来达摩前。\n鹤鸣飞止黄金地，锡杖涌起清凉泉。\n境称尚绝名天下，天台石桥乃其亚。\n千峰不改岁寒时，一水最怜秋月夜。\n半生游学颇艰辛，且向空山老此身。\n也知方丈安禅处，解笑东西南北人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29099,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二","author":"鲜于侁","text":"感公行乐处，蚤莫得相思。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29100,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"鲜于侁","text":"人寻载酒地，雨破看花期。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29101,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其三","author":"鲜于侁","text":"龙却难寻百潭水，地灵长对五峰山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29102,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其四","author":"鲜于侁","text":"乡关素号贤夫子，事论今推圣长官。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29103,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"鲜于夏","text":"六诏漫随丹凤急，一溪聊与白云闲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29104,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"鲜于能","text":"金山一拳石，石髻出溟涨。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29105,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"大涤洞天留题","author":"樊处恭","text":"持杯睥睨不逾时，一派寒声落翠微。\n蛟室倒翻珠乱跃，琼田耕破玉纷飞。\n壮怀摇动频扶槛，溅沫飘零欲湿衣。\n绕涧更须林荫密，呼尊重约扣岩扉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29106,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"沈黎使君与客饮王建梅林分韵作诗过沈犀以诗相示阙树字令汉广补之","author":"樊汉广","text":"墙头冉冉新阳露，忽作玲珑玉千树。\n老蛟偃蹇独避人，卷回飞雪江皋莫。\n何处鸣禽来好音，四月枝垂起黄雾。\n摧折霜馀初不惧，笑看春光等閒度。\n百年梦幻欲无言，吹落吹开岂风故。\n时来荐鼎真偶尔，小住疏篱非不遇。\n我知天地绝茫茫，无为展转独多虑。\n为花悽断却回头，尔亦微酸苦难茹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29107,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"汉炳丹山晚进知学以来尝于文字中敬识先生矣试吏赤水偶逢先生经由为龙多少驻行旆出三诗以贲之汉炳不揆荒拙勉继严韵 其二","author":"樊汉炳","text":"此山胜处非人境，长有烟云拨不开。\n信是天公悭绝胜，晴曦端为使君来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29108,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"汉炳丹山晚进知学以来尝于文字中敬识先生矣试吏赤水偶逢先生经由为龙多少驻行旆出三诗以贲之汉炳不揆荒拙勉继严韵 其三","author":"樊汉炳","text":"披露已谐平日志，开云须信大贤能。\n只馀天道终堪倚，不问人间爱与憎。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29109,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"汉炳丹山晚进知学以来尝于文字中敬识先生矣试吏赤水偶逢先生经由为龙多少驻行旆出三诗以贲之汉炳不揆荒拙勉继严韵 其一","author":"樊汉炳","text":"天仙下寓人间世，爱欲都忘只爱山。\n更向冯仙问陈迹，烟萝深处勇跻攀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29110,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"滴浮泉","author":"樊汝贤","text":"云液落山腹，脉与昆崙通。\n云何山中叟，八十颜桃红。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29111,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"奉化宝化石岩花凤","author":"樊圃","text":"山僧取巧蟠珍丛，九苞占尽千葩红。\n倚阑精彩欲飞动，百鸟不敢啼春风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29112,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"樊宾","text":"耻见横人欺楚约，忍闻稚子劝君行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29113,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"樊预","text":"三声鼓角云中见，一簇楼台海上高。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29114,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽故知容州朝请舅 其一","author":"樊梦辰","text":"人物晨星似，谁欤硬脊梁。\n高风思靖节，流派到平塘。\n勇向急流退，归来三径荒。\n未为先懒句，寄傲益增光。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29115,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二","author":"滕元发","text":"寒日边声断，春风塞草长。\n传闻汉都护，归奉万年觞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29116,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"浮云楼","author":"滕元发","text":"举头便是长安日，弄袖时飘梦泽风。\n茂苑久抛飞鸟外，楚台遥在碧云中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29117,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送俞汝尚致仕还乡","author":"滕元发","text":"清明冲节是身谋，御史郎官不肯留。\n回首轩裳双脱屣，放怀天地一轻沤。\n卞云苕月柴门静，菱雨蘋风野艇秋。\n仰羡冥鸿空自愧，区区图报未知休。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29118,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送程给事知越州","author":"滕元发","text":"又领州麾过故乡，谁怜肝胆异班行。\n患销南海城先具，气压胡天国自强。\n造膝华褒辉黼黻，跋朝佳句敌琳琅。\n圣君求治如星火，休斗新诗万丈光。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29119,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄越州范希文太守","author":"滕元发","text":"江山千里接仁风，都在东南秀气中。\n为问玉皇香案吏，蓬莱何似水晶宫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29120,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其四","author":"滕元发","text":"野色更无山隔断，天光直与水相连。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29121,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其五","author":"滕元发","text":"负鼎早为汤右相，有文今作鲁夫人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29122,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"滕元发","text":"万国休兵外，群生奏凯中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29123,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其六","author":"滕元发","text":"主人留客醉，酒美蟹螯肥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29124,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其三","author":"滕元发","text":"葱岭占佳气，毡裘拜未央。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29125,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"七绝三首 其二","author":"滕白","text":"周遭圩岸缭山城，一眼圩田翠不分。\n行到秋苗初熟处，翠茸锦上织黄云。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29126,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"七绝三首 其一","author":"滕白","text":"稻穗登场谷满车，家家鸡犬更桑麻。\n谩栽木槿成篱落，已得清阴又得花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29127,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山行","author":"滕白","text":"马头閒觉入从容，叠嶂清秋度百重。\n长见孤云能作雨，未应片水不藏龙。\n花村几处连修竹，涧石谁家倚瘦松。\n本若无心许明代，好寻巢许此韬踪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29128,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和刘颖呈张经略韵","author":"滕㢗","text":"隐然重望压边尘，号令风生玉帐兵。\n诗思江山真得助，威声草木尽知名。\n要令万顷窥黄宪，不把千畦付曲生。\n坐使胜游还旧观，追随那得胜公荣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29129,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山矾","author":"滕岑","text":"水仙委蛇江梅老，架上酴醾雪未翻。\n千斛妙香留不用，一时分付与山矾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29130,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"江上望西兴","author":"滕岑","text":"跨浦桥边万里风，客帆去尽暮江空。\n西兴只在斜阳里，白壁青林淡染红。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29131,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杏花","author":"滕岑","text":"君家两杏闹春色，浓淡胭脂染不齐。\n试唤赵昌来貌取，若边好著白鹇栖。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29132,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋江四绝 其三","author":"滕岑","text":"一川晚色澹烟浮，不觉潮生水倒流。\n人语津亭灯火闹，客帆椎鼓过沙洲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29133,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋江四绝 其二","author":"滕岑","text":"风色萧萧日色晴，晚潮未到水波平。\n系槎艇子关蓬睡，不管溪南唤渡声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29134,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋江四绝 其四","author":"滕岑","text":"玉轮推上暮云端，金蹙波心一片澜。\n隐隐渔舟横绝去，何人江岸倚楼看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29135,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋江四绝 其一","author":"滕岑","text":"十日江头一向风，差差寒浪白吹空。\n渔舠轾小不如叶，信意低昂风浪中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29136,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"惜梅 其三","author":"滕岑","text":"牧孺樵童不管春，乱攀曾不比荆榛。\n那知立马江南客，一萼真香泪一巾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29137,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"惜梅 其一","author":"滕岑","text":"沙晴日暖雪消时，春到南枝未觉迟。\n东崦人家三百树，与君扶杖试寻之。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29138,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"惜梅 其二","author":"滕岑","text":"沈瘦难禁诗作魔，年年诗句为花多。\n亦知习气要除尽，奈此高风胜韵何。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29139,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梅花 其三","author":"滕岑","text":"色香其实无与比，摹写百端良可嗟。\n我今与下语一则，此是梅花非别花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29140,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梅花 其二","author":"滕岑","text":"论白人惟议冰雪，言香佛亦取旃檀。\n旃檀冰雪固大好，只恐将渠比并难。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29141,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梅花 其一","author":"滕岑","text":"欲寻好句乞梅花，从实平章不要誇。\n且道色香谁可比，口才拟议即成差。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29142,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游西湖五首 其五","author":"滕岑","text":"丰乐楼头沸管弦，拍床唤酒记当年。\n而今寂寞空栏楯，楼下涟漪自宛然。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29143,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游西湖五首 其四","author":"滕岑","text":"乍来乍去堤边鹭，似有似无烟里山。\n何人为展古画轴，尘暗缣绡浓淡间。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29144,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游西湖五首 其三","author":"滕岑","text":"林君庐不存已久，苏公堤比旧尤佳。\n绝怜夹堤柳渐暗，谁见傍庐梅正花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29145,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游西湖五首 其二","author":"滕岑","text":"雪寒映湖湖水明，西子淡妆仍浅颦。\n不会吴儿底心性，冒寒湖上去寻春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29146,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游西湖五首 其一","author":"滕岑","text":"白浪吹船投跨浦，黄尘扑帽走沙河。\n若无西湖一慰眼，奈此客中劳悴何。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29147,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"蒋中丞庭下芙蓉 其三","author":"滕岑","text":"菊与为朋竹与邻，闭门谁见晓妆新。\n不须多羡苏堤好，车马往来尘污人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29148,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"蒋中丞庭下芙蓉 其二","author":"滕岑","text":"莫把秋芳与春比，物生各各以时行。\n只今独步西风里，那得春花与抗衡。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29149,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"蒋中丞庭下芙蓉 其一","author":"滕岑","text":"西风吹下一庭秋，秋自无聊花更愁。\n醉脸晚来红拂掠，未妨萧瑟却风流。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29150,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"酴醾 其三","author":"滕岑","text":"群芳谁不让天柔，笑杀金沙敢并游。\n少借馀妍入樽酒，真堪一斗博凉州。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29151,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"酴醾 其一","author":"滕岑","text":"红紫从渠巧斗新，不妨自著素衣巾。\n中庭今夜群仙戏，总是广寒宫里人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29152,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"酴醾 其二","author":"滕岑","text":"向人未肯吐芳心，玉困香融己不禁。\n久矣禅心无色想，如何对此独沉吟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29153,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题钓台对严氏楼三首 其三","author":"滕岑","text":"秋江不许一尘染，只有青山倒影寒。\n我欲移家来住此，烦君先为斩鱼竿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29154,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题钓台对严氏楼三首 其二","author":"滕岑","text":"乃祖高怀傲帝王，远孙依旧晦文章。\n不须苦要为官去，看水看山味最长。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29155,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题钓台对严氏楼三首 其一","author":"滕岑","text":"扁舟江上几曾经，山崦层楼似画屏。\n岂料今为倚楼客，谁能添我入丹青。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29156,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠徐谷三绝 其三","author":"滕岑","text":"曾向林间对酒卮，不嫌俗物亦伸眉。\n江湖若许同归去，能为先生理钓丝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29157,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠徐谷三绝 其一","author":"滕岑","text":"解后逢君醉山县，殷勤访我到江城。\n闲携箬笠无人识，狂杀痴儿问五行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29158,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠徐谷三绝 其二","author":"滕岑","text":"裂去儒冠今几年，颠毛萧索任垂肩。\n相逢记得初相识，回首西风一泫然。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29159,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九日求米","author":"滕岑","text":"绝粮缺酒两堪悲，宁可无杯不可饥。\n谩有黄花供老眼，正无红粒续晨炊。\n太官羔酒何须羡，朝士茱萸亦谩思。\n聊与重阳添故事，不妨乞米赋新诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29160,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵乐天山居","author":"滕岑","text":"不能蚤岁作农夫，强学为儒途路迂。\n老有微官沾薄禄，钝无捷径上荣衢。\n遥峰窣堵似屏展，近岸拒霜如锦铺。\n莫笑吾庐大幽寂，眼前此景一村无。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29161,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵乐天目昏","author":"滕岑","text":"百年今已八十五，此去光阴能几多。\n足病半生为我祟，目昏今日奈渠何。\n也知乱膜无方法，正为耽书被折磨。\n瞽者欲行须用杖，不如安稳坐盘陀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29162,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵乐天村居卧病 其三","author":"滕岑","text":"瓦盏茅柴浊，砖炉榾柮红。\n味如饮醽醁，暖胜燎蒿蓬。\n万种皆幻事，一真惟太空。\n旧毡敷故絮，小閤卧衰翁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29163,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"闲题","author":"滕岑","text":"漏云残日凄欲阴，占巢归鹭纷投林。\n风吹旷野暮色白，山近小窗秋意深。\n已将梦事了得丧，更凭杯酒寄浮沉。\n书生习气难料理，有底苦吟劳此心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29164,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和方薄山居","author":"滕岑","text":"江村宜晚景，老眼见来稀。\n远岫屏六出，残霞锦一机。\n月华池上好，暑气竹间微。\n不羡御风列，旬馀五日归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29165,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"拄杖","author":"滕岑","text":"久矣相随若弟昆，周全险阻可须论。\n断桥测水露半影，野路擉泥留乱痕。\n痴坐自怜今日懒，颠持敢忘昔年恩。\n得君分付吾何恨，休向林间打睡门。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29166,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋晚","author":"滕岑","text":"槭槭霜风劲，骎骎物象彫。\n屡迁怜蟋蟀，一败笑芭蕉。\n林叶疏逾响，山云薄易消。\n虽无远行役，对此亦何聊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29167,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄友人王晋老","author":"滕岑","text":"送君行日雪扬飞，曾几何时画箑挥。\n自别空惊须发变，得书聊證梦魂非。\n紫枢白简家声在，黄卷青灯生事微。\n悟得随缘安乐法，不应羁旅更沾衣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29168,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"绿柿寄开欲游钓台以诗谢","author":"滕岑","text":"西城好在朱夫子，屈指经年隔笑谈。\n忽枉尺书相劳苦，更蒙绿柿远分甘。\n似闻欲访严陵濑，何惜暂辞弥勒龛。\n已约桐君候舟楫，当令风月往迎参。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29169,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"楼上偶成 其二","author":"滕岑","text":"陇麦已抽穟，山田未立苗。\n雨声愁昨夕，晴色喜今朝。\n柳絮青天雪，松风陆地潮。\n山居足幽事，吾隐不须招。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29170,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}}]